    "depends_on": [],
    "enables": []
  },
  "scope_notes": "Touches validation logic in src/validation.cpp by adding the CheckInputScriptsFor enum to distinguish mempool from block validation error reporting and introducing a consteval ConsensusScriptVerifyFlags helper.",
  "changed_since_previous": "Added release notes for -acceptnonstdtxn changes.",
  "card": "Allows transactions violating standard non-mandatory script verification flags (such as OP_NOPx or OP_SUCCESS) to be admitted into the mempool and relayed when running with -acceptnonstdtxn=1 on test networks. Previously, test network nodes with non-standard transaction acceptance enabled still enforced STANDARD_SCRIPT_VERIFY_FLAGS during policy checks. The PR also replaces a script flag-mask heuristic in CheckInputScripts with an explicit block-versus-mempool enum and adds compile-time assertions ensuring standard flags subsume all consensus flags.",
